      "name": "Broad Peak IN Hooded Jacket Men",
      "slug": "mammut-broad-peak-in-hooded-jacket-men",
      "description": "Functional performance year-round down jacket",
      "longDescription": "<p>The <strong>Broad Peak IN Hooded Jacket</strong> is Mammut's flagship insulation layer for alpine pursuits. Filled with 700-fill-power down and wrapped in a GORE-TEX shell, it handles everything from belays to summit pushes.</p><ul><li>700-fill-power responsible down</li><li>GORE-TEX outer shell</li><li>Helmet-compatible hood</li><li>Packable into its own chest pocket</li></ul>",
